Gameplay combines exploration, melee and ranged combat, raids, character progression, dialogue choices, and settlement management. Players can form alliances with regional leaders, acquire equipment and abilities, and expand their settlement by constructing and upgrading buildings.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/assassins-creed-valhalla', '["Google Stadia", "Xbox Series X|S", "PlayStation 4", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "PlayStation 5", "Xbox One"]', NULL, 8.0, 0, 10.01, '2026-11-26 02:21:07', '2026-11-26 02:21:07')
