VALUES (NULL, NULL, 11205, 'Anno 2205', 'Anno 2205', 'game', 2015, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/cocsie.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/erd9p5pbefllmt6pv2mf.jpg', 'In Anno 2205, you join humankind‘s next step into the future with the promise to build a better tomorrow. You conquer Earth, establishing rich, bustling cities and grand industrial complexes, but to secure the prosperity of your people, you must travel into space.

A scientific breakthrough in fusion energy promises to revolutionise all aspects of society. The necessary isotope, helium-3, can only be found in harvestable quantities on the Moon. Venture into space and settle on the Moon in the thrilling race for resource and power.

Anno’s masterful economic gameplay is back and taking strategic city-building simulation to new heights, launching into space!', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/anno-2205', '["PC (Microsoft Windows)"]', NULL, 6.9, 0, 1.06200000000000009e+01, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-26 02:21:07')
