Build, explore, survive in this terrifying first person survival horror simulator.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/the-forest', '["PlayStation 4", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "SteamVR"]', NULL, 7.8, 0, 6.2675, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-26 02:21:07')
